  "description": "LIRRAI crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C140 H144 Dy4 N12 O16,2(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4A (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.590-3.899 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.74-112.80°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(μ3-OH)2(tmhd)4L6]·2CH3CN (C144H150Dy4N14O16). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
